apophysis-j is a port in java of the famous fractal flame editor apophysis for Windows. It is based on the 
version 2.07 beta of apophysis. It should run on any machine equipped with a decent java environment (1.8 or higher)
and bring the capabilities of this wonderful program to mac and linux users at last.

This project is now built with Maven.

From the main directory, build the project and execute all unit tests using:
`mvn clean install`

Or to simply compile and package:
`mvn clean package`

To run the output JAR:
`java -jar target/apophysis-j-[version].jar`

Releases are automatically verified and built through our GitHub Actions CI pipeline.

